  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 7478107015841187976
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 524d737709eaff74c9db275b7ab92f00, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: This part is solid now.
    - rid: 3186918032358132746
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: You sound surprised.
    - rid: 1227388623051005694
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 524d737709eaff74c9db275b7ab92f00, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: I am careful with praise.
    - rid: 5283218623699715994
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2757966820b1c56408bfbbd8d30dd10f, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: He means he likes it.
    - rid: 1497489147840142795
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 524d737709eaff74c9db275b7ab92f00, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: I mean I will not have to redo it.
    - rid: 8079132639872943152
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2757966820b1c56408bfbbd8d30dd10f, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: That is practically a standing ovation from Theo.
    - rid: 4861821753149285341
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: I will treasure the moment.
    - rid: 3186984414252168929
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 524d737709eaff74c9db275b7ab92f00, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Do not become overconfident.
    - rid: 4939067043235720618
      type: {class: ThoughtStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: I think that was another compliment.
